  "description": "HTTP header names and prefixes that Ferrum Edge owns: gateway assertions to backends, gateway diagnostic response headers, internal markers, mesh control headers, and admin API headers. Names are case-insensitive; prefixes match any lowercase name that starts with them. Entries with availability \"unreleased\" are on Edge main only.",
